  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '"Accessible Entrances" often double as waste disposal or service entrances.
    This isn''t truly accessible and is embarrasing to those that have to use them.


    Designers
    must keep this in mind when hosting disabled colleagues and players at their
    studio and for represnting their experiences within games. How would a disabled
    person access the building i''m creating? Is this giving off the message I want?'
